#: definitions.json
msgid "Extensions of network protocols for 3G/LTE"
msgstr "Extensões de protocolos de rede para 3G/LTE"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Support for Turris Omnia and Turris MOX LTE pack."
msgstr "Suporte para pacote Turris Omnia e Turris MOX LTE."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Advanced security & analytics - Turris Sentinel"
msgstr "Segurança & Análise avançada - Sentinela do Turris"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Software for participation in threat detection program which provides "
"distributed adaptive firewall and statistics."
msgstr ""
"Software para participação em programa de detecção de ameaças que fornece "
"firewall adaptativa distribuída e estatísticas."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Usage Survey"
msgstr "Inquérito de Utilização"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Collects data about router usage (installed packages, Internet connection "
"type and etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Recolhe dados acerca da utilização do router (pacotes instalados, tipo de "
"ligação à Internet e etc.)."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Dynamic Firewall"
msgstr "Firewall Dinâmica"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Adds firewall rules to block attackers detected by Turris Sentinel network."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona regras de firewall para bloquear os atacantes detetados pela rede "
"Sentinela Turris."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Firewall Logs"
msgstr "Relatórios da Firewall"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Threat detection tool. Collects firewall logs about failed connection "
"attempts."
msgstr ""
"Ferramenta de detecção de ameaça. Recolhe relatórios de firewall sobre "
"tentativas de ligação falhadas."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Minipots"
msgstr "Mini potes"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Threat detection tool. Minimal honeypots to catch attackers by mimicking "
"various protocols."
msgstr ""
"Ferramenta de detecção de ameaça. Potes de mel mínimos para apanhar "
"atacantes ao imitarem vários protocolos."

#: definitions.json
msgid "SSH Honeypot"
msgstr "Pote de Mel SSH"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Threat detection tool. SSH honeypot using Honeypot as a Service "
"(haas.nic.cz)."
msgstr ""
"Ferramenta de detecção de ameaça. Pote de mel SSH que usa Honeypot como um "
"Serviço (haas.nic.cz)."

#: definitions.json
msgid "RIPE Atlas SW Probe"
msgstr "Prova RIPE Atlas SW"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Global platform, which measures Internet connectivity and reachability."
msgstr ""
"Plataforma global, que mede a conectividade e acessibilidade da Internet."

#: definitions.json
msgid "DVB tuner"
msgstr "Sintonizador DVB"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Software for sharing television received by a DVB tuner on Turris. Does not "
"include device drivers."
msgstr ""
"Software para partilhar televisão recebida por um sintonizador DVB em "
"Turris. Não inclui as drivers de dispositivo."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Hardening"
msgstr "Endurecimento"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Seccomp tools for system hardening."
msgstr "Ferramentas Seccomp para endurecimento do sistema."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Common passwords filter"
msgstr "Filtro de palavras passe comuns"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Compare new password you are about to set to access router with list of "
"common passwords used by robots trapped in Turris honeypots."
msgstr ""
"Compara a nova palavra passe que está prestes a definir para acesso ao "
"router com uma lista de palavras passe comuns usadas por robots apanhados "
"nos potes de mel do Turris."

#: definitions.json
msgid "OpenWrt's process jail"
msgstr "Prisão de processos do OpenWrt"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"ujail allows to limit processes by limiting syscalls and file-system access"
msgstr ""
"ujail permite limitar processos ao limitar chamadas de sistema e acesso ao "
"sistema de ficheiros"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Secure Computing Mode (seccomp)"
msgstr "Modo de Computação Seguro (seccomp)"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Optional support for seccomp allowing processes to isolate from them self"
msgstr ""
"Suporte opcional para seccomp que permite aos processos isolarem-se de si "
"próprios"

#: definitions.json
msgid "LuCI extensions"
msgstr "Extensões LuCI"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Several additional tabs and controls for the advanced LuCI interface."
msgstr ""
"Vários separadores e controles adicionais para a interface LuCI avançada."

#: definitions.json
msgid "AdBlock"
msgstr "AdBlock"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Script to block ad/abuse domains."
msgstr "Script para bloquear domínios de publicidade/abusos."

#: definitions.json
msgid "SQM"
msgstr "SQM"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Active Queue Management to boost performance on heavily loaded network."
msgstr ""
"Gestão de Filas Ativa para amplificar a performance em rede de alta carga."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Tinyproxy"
msgstr "Tinyproxy"

#: definitions.json
msgid "HTTP(S) proxy."
msgstr "Proxy HTTP(S)."

#: definitions.json
msgid "UPnP"
msgstr "UPnP"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Universal Plug and Play service."
msgstr "Serviço Universal Plug e Play."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Print server (p910nd)"
msgstr "Servidor de Impressão (p910nd)"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Services allowing to connect a printer to the router and use it for remote "
"printing."
msgstr ""
"Serviços que permitem ligar uma impressora ao router e usa-la para impressão "
"remota."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Estatísticas"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Gather and render diagrams for system statistics by using collectd."
msgstr ""
"Recolhe e desenha diagramas para estatísticas de sistema ao usar o collectd."

#: definitions.json
msgid "WireGuard"
msgstr "WireGuard"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Alternative to OpenVPN, it provides fast, modern and secure VPN tunnel."
msgstr "Alternativa ao OpenVPN, fornece um túnel VPN rápido, moderno e seguro."

#: definitions.json
msgid "LXC utilities"
msgstr "Utilitários LXC"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Set of utilities to manage Linux Containers (lightweight virtualization "
"technology)."
msgstr ""
"Conjunto de utilitários para gerir Contentores Linux (tecnologia de "
"virtualização leve)."

#: definitions.json
msgid "NAS"
msgstr "NAS"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Services allowing to connect a disk to the router and use it as network data"
" store."
msgstr ""
"Serviços que permitem ligar um disco ao router e usa-lo como um armazém de "
"dados de rede."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Samba"
msgstr "Samba"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Implementation of SMB network protocol."
msgstr "Implementação do protocolo de rede SMB."

#: definitions.json
msgid "DLNA"
msgstr "DLNA"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Digital media sharing server."
msgstr "Servidor de partilha de média digital."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Transmission"
msgstr "Transmissão"

#: definitions.json
msgid "BitTorrent client."
msgstr "Cliente do BitTorrent."

#: definitions.json
msgid "mdadm"
msgstr "mdadm"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Software RAID storage support using mdadm."
msgstr "Software de suporte de armazenamento RAID que usa mdadm."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Encrypted Storage"
msgstr "Armazenamento Encriptado"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Add support to access encrypted storage devices using dm-crypt."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona suporte para acesso a dispositivos de armazenamento encriptado "
"usando dm-crypt."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Network monitoring and parental control"
msgstr "Monitorização de rede e controlo parental"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Tools to monitor local network and users on it."
msgstr "Ferramentas para monitorizar a rede local e os utilizadores nela."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Internet connection speed measurement"
msgstr "Medição de velocidade da ligação de Internet"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Actively measures speed of Internet connection using netmetr.cz service."
msgstr ""
"Mede ativamente a velocidade da ligação de Internet usando o serviço "
"netmetr.cz."

#: definitions.json
msgid "New devices detection"
msgstr "Detecção de novos dispositivos"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Software for detecting new devices on local network."
msgstr "Software para detectar novos dispositivos na rede local."

#: definitions.json
msgid "Pakon"
msgstr "Pakon"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Software for in depth monitoring of your traffic using Suricata."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Morce"
msgstr "Morce"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Simple integration of Intrusion Detection System."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Turris MOX network boot"
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Server-side for Turris MOX without microSD card used as Wi-Fi access point."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Netdata"
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Real-time perfomance and health monitoring options."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Nextcloud"
msgstr "Nextcloud"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Self-hosted files hosting and productivity platform that keeps you in "
"control. Alternative to services such as Dropbox or Google Drive."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "OpenVPN"
msgstr "OpenVPN"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Easy setup of the OpenVPN client and server from Foris."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Tor"
msgstr "Tor"

#: definitions.json
msgid "Service to increase anonymity on the Internet."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Alternative core drivers"
msgstr "Drivers de núcleo alternativas"

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"These options allow you to use alternative drivers over those available in "
"default installation. You can try to enable these if you encounter some "
"problems with default ones."
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Candela Technologies Wi-Fi drivers for Qualcomm Atheros QCA988x"
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid "Alternative driver from Candela Technologies."
msgstr "Driver alternativa de Candela Technologies."

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Candela Technologies Wi-Fi drivers for Qualcomm Atheros QCA988x with "
"improved stability in busy networks"
msgstr ""

#: definitions.json
msgid ""
"Alternative driver from Candela Technologies. It uses HTT TX data path for "
"management frames, which improves stability in busy networks."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "Advanced users"
msgstr "Utilizadores avançados"

#: labels.json
msgid "This functionality is usable only for advanced users."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Comunidade"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"This package list is not officially supported. Turris team has no "
"responsibility for stability of software that is part of this list."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "Experimental"
msgstr "Experimental"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"Software that is part of this package list is considered experimental. "
"Problems when using it might be expected."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "Descontinuado"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"This package list and/or software that provides is planned to be removed. It"
" is advised to not use it."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "External storage"
msgstr "Armazenamento externo"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"Using external storage is highly suggested for this package list usage. "
"Software it contains can wear out flash storages as it performs increased "
"amount of writes."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "High memory usage"
msgstr "Alta utilização de memória"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"Software in this package list consumes possibly higher amount of RAM to run."
" It is not suggested to use it with small memory."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "High storage usage"
msgstr "Alta utilização de armazenamento"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"Software in this package list consumes possibly higher amount of storage "
"space to install. It is not suggested to use it with small storages such as "
"internal storage of Turris 1.x and microSD cards with less than 1GB of "
"storage."
msgstr ""

#: labels.json
msgid "Network load"
msgstr "Carga de rede"

#: labels.json
msgid ""
"This functionality can decrease network performance. That can be felt only "
"on faster uplinks but because of that it still can be decremental to some "
"users."
msgstr ""
